# ADR Reporting & Documentation

## Project Overview

This simulated pharmacovigilance project demonstrates the completion of a structured Adverse Drug Reaction (ADR) reporting form based on a patient case scenario.

The exercise focuses on collecting, evaluating, and documenting essential safety information required for pharmacovigilance reporting.

