## Documentation Approach

The case was documented using the following pharmacovigilance principles:

- Identification of the patient and reporter information
- Documentation of the suspected medicinal product
- Recording of the adverse event
- Assessment of treatment and event timelines
- Documentation of seriousness criteria
- Recording of concomitant medication
- Assessment of dechallenge and rechallenge
- Documentation of the suspected drug-event relationship

